      "title": "The two config settings + click, right-click and KeyHint behaviour",
      "status": "planned",
      "description": "`workspace_collapsed_style` and `pane_collapsed_style`, both `[appearance]`, typed snake_case enums defaulting to \"icon\", both added to config.default.toml and the README.\n\nBehaviour: a workspace cell click TOGGLES its pane list and does NOT switch workspace; a pane cell click focuses that pane. Right-click shows the SAME context menu as the expanded form — reuse the existing builders. The universal picker stamps letters over the cells. Column-target picks are unavailable while collapsed — an accepted limitation.",
      "notes": "",
      "statusLog": [],
      "decisions": [],
      "acceptedDecisions": [],
      "checklist": [
