      "priority": 4,
      "shortName": "action-first-then-drag",
      "title": "The move is an ACTION first; drag is only the mouse surface",
      "status": "planned",
      "description": "⚠️ Build the action BEFORE the drag. On drop, dispatch `chrome.dock.move_to_region` / `chrome.dock.reorder_before` through the registry — never mutate directly. The same move MUST be reachable by keyboard and RPC (input parity, AGENTS.md). A drag that does something no keybinding can do is a rule violation.",
      "notes": "",
      "statusLog": [],
      "decisions": [],
      "acceptedDecisions": [],
